tlas","/farmland-atlas/nebraska/buffalo-county"],["ARC or PLC in Buffalo County","/arc-plc/nebraska/buffalo-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Buffalo County record runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 42 of those years, and in 2025 it landed at 22% of normal. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 17% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 25023 had its driest year in 2012, at 52% of normal.</p>"}
